**`<project_files>`** — When in a project, lists the project's files by path, mounted read-only.

**`<available_skills>`** — A long catalog of skills the model can invoke, each with a name, description, and file path. Includes public skills (document formats, frontend design, file reading), example skills, plugin suites (legal, finance, data, productivity), and any user-created skills, which appear under a separate user path.

**`<network_configuration>` / `<filesystem_configuration>`** — Sandbox permissions. Network egress settings and the list of read-only mounts.

